Z||000000||capt_ron||05-11-2001||12:00 AM||||Need second opinion.<BR>I rarely drive my 87SE because of a bad back but when I do the A/C works. My G/F drives the car to work everyday and says that the A/C only works sometimes. Everything checks out but the compressor clutch will not energize unless the rpm reaches 3600. It drops out again around 2000rpm. Also the cruise control surged and dropped out while checking the A/C on the road.<BR>Also I've noticed that when she starts the car in the morning it doesn't fire instantly any more, other than that it idles and runs like a sewing machine.<P>I'm of the opinion that the ECM is the culprit. Any Seconds?<P>Thanks,<BR>Capt Ron||||reg||1
